<p>Haaye Naushaah E Karbala Qasim Asws.</p>

<p> 1. Ya Quda Phool Sa Badan Tera.</p>

<p>Kitne Tukdo'N Mein Bant Gaya Qasim Asws.</p>

<p> 2. Boli Ghurbat Bhi Aaj Ghurbat Ki</p>

<p>Hogayi Tujhpe Inteha Qasim Asws.</p>

<p> 3. Der Aane Mein Hogayi Beta</p>

<p>Tujhse Sharminda Hai Chacha Qasim Asws.</p>

<p> 4. Lab Pe Sahil Ke Aur Kumail Ke Hai</p>

<p>Tu Hai Naushahe Karbala Qasim Asws.</p>

<p> Az: Alamdar Sahil Sahab</p>